  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It'd be useful to be able to set some arbitrary data with each player in the world, retrievable from the player's PlayerAPI object both locally and from other clients (synced):\n```\nvoid VRCPlayerAPI.setData(byte[]);\nbyte[] VRCPlayerAPI.getData();\n```\nFor example, a health bar, team association, score.\nIt's currently possible have per-player global state by having each player take ownership of an UdonBehavior with synced variables on it, but managing the ownership through players joining or leaving is pretty tricky.",
